# Frontend Standards (lazy-loaded)

Full standards: `.hive/standards/frontend.mdc`

## Quick reference

- Functional components only — no class components
- Three-state pattern always: `loading` / `error` / `success`
- No HTTP calls in components — use service layer
- Use project UI library (see `.hive/standards/frontend.mdc`) — no raw HTML equivalents
- All props typed — no implicit `any`
- Accessibility: `aria-label` on all interactive elements
- No anonymous default exports
